      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9DEC544C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "먹이를 주고 있다고 하셨죠?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BA39C774B97C0020C8FCACE00020C788B2E4ACE00020D558C168C8E0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그 뒤로 무사히\n루차불을 만날 수 있었어요!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n아주 녹초가 되어 있었지만요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF80020B4A4B85C0020BB34C0ACD788000AB8E8CC28BD88C7440020B9CCB0A00020C2180020C788C5C8C5B4C694002100100001BE00000AC544C8FC0020B179CD08AC000020B418C5B40020C788C5C8C9C0B9CCC694002E00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그런데... 그 일이 있은 후로\n루차불이 좀 이상해졌어요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F0B370002E002E002E0020ADF80020C77CC7740020C788C7400020D6C4B85C000AB8E8CC28BD88C7740020C8800020C774C0C1D574C84CC5B4C694002E00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "항상 먼 곳을 바라보고 있더라구요.\n마치 무언가를 회상하고 있는 것처럼요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŶ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D56DC0C10020BA3C0020ACF3C7440020BC14B77CBCF4ACE00020C788B354B77CAD6CC694002E000AB9C8CE580020BB34C5B8AC00B97C0020D68CC0C1D558ACE00020C788B2940020AC83CC98B7FCC694002E002E002E00100002011401760000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
